  "decisions": [
    "Remove declaration-wide generic move rejection; defer templates and validate closed primary/additional ownership shapes.",
    "Retain concrete move diagnostics before inlining replaces function/parameter nodes with lexical bindings. Reuse the existing code37 type/trait predicate and source locations.",
    "An existing producer loop controls downstream break/continue. With no such loop, the first receiver supplies a single-iteration source scope, which must hide caller loops.",
    "Fallback continue exits that source scope, not just the current emit callback.",
    "Keep caller-owned values surviving argument evaluation and release abandoned producer values. Four managed allocation audits passed."
  ],
